417	## Add it to your video
418	
419	It runs for 4.8 seconds at 1920×1080. Paste this into your composition:
420	
421	```html index.html
422	<div
423	  data-composition-id="lt-neon-border"
424	  data-composition-src="compositions/lt-neon-border.html"
425	  data-start="0"
426	  data-duration="4.8"
427	  data-track-index="1"
428	  data-width="1920"
429	  data-height="1080"
430	></div>
431	```
432	
433	Move it in time with `data-start`. Put it on a different timeline row with
434	`data-track-index`. See [data attributes](/concepts/data-attributes) for the rest.
435	
436	## Change how it looks
437	
438	Set these CSS variables on the block:
439	
440	- `undefined` — Name. Defaults to `Dr. Maya Chen`.
441	- `undefined` — Role. Defaults to `Host · Neuroscientist`.
442	- `undefined` — Accent. Defaults to `#cc9149`.
443	- `undefined` — Movement. Defaults to `step`. Options: `step`, `glide`.
444	- `undefined` — Speed. Defaults to `1.6`.
445	- `undefined` — Corner radius. Defaults to `26`.
446	- `undefined` — Thickness. Defaults to `5`.
447	- `undefined` — Arc length. Defaults to `22`.
448	- `undefined` — Glow. Defaults to `1`.
449	
450	## Variables
451	
452	Every one of these has a default, so the piece works untouched. Set the ones you
453	want to change on the element:
454	
455	| Variable | Default | Accepts | What it does |
456	| --- | --- | --- | --- |
457	| `name` | `Dr. Maya Chen` | string |  |
458	| `role` | `Host · Neuroscientist` | string |  |
459	| `accent` | `#cc9149` | color |  |
460	| `movement` | `step` | `step`, `glide` |  |
461	| `speed` | `1.6` | 0.2corners/s to 6corners/s, step 0.1corners/s |  |
462	| `cornerRadius` | `26` | 0px to 90px, step 1px |  |
463	| `thickness` | `5` | 1px to 16px, step 1px |  |
464	| `arcLength` | `22` | 5% to 100%, step 1% |  |
465	| `glow` | `1` | 0x to 2x, step 0.05x |  |
